<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg rating raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg rating raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim has raised its rating on Kellogg Co to perform in line from underperform, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Battle Creek, Mich.-based firm, the world's largest cereal maker, were trading at 67-3/4, up 1/2.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Bill Cummins was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
